{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Safe Spelunking plunges players into a series of increasingly perilous cave systems, each boasting distinct &amp; visually striking biomes. Beginning at the Base Camp, the player can prepare for descent &amp; select levels by navigating through thematic cavern entrances. Every run is procedurally generated, creating a new experience every time you punch in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOTIC COMBAT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap out between weapons in the base camp and battle long forgotten employees. Collect health and resources to defeat bosses. Don\u2019t forget about the traps, or they might blow up in your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES, UPGRADES, UPGRADES! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During every run, you collect experience you can use to upgrade your character. Want to run faster? Easy. Want to hit super hard? You can do that too.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975720?t=1757897743","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975720?t=1757897743","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975720/a462e86d83da257015fb9c532da7df3c3e319451/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757897743","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975720/a462e86d83da257015fb9c532da7df3c3e319451/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757897743","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Safe Spelunking plunges players into a series of increasingly perilous cave systems, each boasting distinct &amp; visually striking biomes. Beginning at the Base Camp, the player can prepare for descent &amp; select levels by navigating through thematic cavern entrances. Every run is procedurally generated, creating a new experience every time you punch in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOTIC COMBAT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap out between weapons in the base camp and battle long forgotten employees. Collect health and resources to defeat bosses. Don\u2019t forget about the traps, or they might blow up in your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UPGRADES, UPGRADES, UPGRADES! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During every run, you collect experience you can use to upgrade your character. Want to run faster? Easy. Want to hit super hard? You can do that too.</p>","developers":["Team False Assurances"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975720/1bc112c311629fdbeaaa508458c27331a6a799a3/header.jpg?t=1757897743","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257197572,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197572/movie480.mp4?t=1757886348","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197572/movie_max.mp4?t=1757886348"},"name":"Super Safe Spelunking - Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257197572/6e453ab8fd74717bcd58e4ff0ddca1fedfa1006a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757886348","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197572/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757886348","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257197572/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757886348"}}],"name":"Super Safe Spelunking","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Stora